# NestMatch Client Environment Variables
# CRITICAL SECURITY NOTE: All VITE_ variables are bundled into client JavaScript and are PUBLICLY VISIBLE.
# NEVER place database connection strings, passwords, or JWT secrets here.

# Backend REST API Base URL:
# - For Docker Nginx reverse proxy: /api
# - For local standalone Vite dev:   http://localhost:5000/api
# - For cloud deployment (Vercel):  https://your-nestmatch-backend.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
